---
title: Request frontend → response
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant A0 as Client
    participant A1 as index / framework
    participant A2 as Router / Action
    participant A3 as Controller / Loader
    participant A4 as Model / DB
    participant A5 as Template / Response
    A0->>A1: GET route=marketplace/extension
    A1->>A2: pre-actions rồi dispatch startup/router
    A2->>A3: before → Action::execute(index)
    A3->>A4: getTotalExtensions rồi getExtensions
    A4->>A3: SQL rows qua DB::query()
    A3->>A5: load-&gt;view(extension_list) → setOutput
    A3->>A2: return → controller after
    A1->>A5: Response::output()
    A5->>A0: HTTP HTML
